What I understood you are asking for:
1. "With our tumor RNA-seq, motif data and a protein interaction map, we want to identify which transcription factors physically assemble into complexes and estimate the stoichiometry of each complex." -- not available here: no registered workflow produces this. PANDA does not give it: the PPI network is an input of possible TF cooperation. PANDA refines a cooperativity matrix internally, but the executor does not save it, and it is not a measurement of physical complexes or stoichiometry.

No registered workflow produces this, so none is offered as the way to get it.

No files were inspected and no analysis ran.
